  "details": "I think it would be great if worlds had an icon or a disclaimer on the world details page stating if it has Creator Economy features implemented in it.\n\nAlong the lines of how mobile app stores have a tag for \"Contains In-App Purchases\". Something like \"Offers paid subscriptions\".",
